<%/* A pop-out window: the design surface alone, filling the window. It
     connects to the design's channel as a window, which is how the surface
     beside the chat knows to step aside while it is open. Its size and
     client are its own, so it can show another size than the panel. In the
     desktop app it is a real window, which remembers its size and place; in
     a browser, a tab the browser reuses. The page is the same in both. */%>
<div class="stack design-page window-page">
  <%~ include('./_surface', { ...it, view: 'window' }) %>
</div>
